# Search from the overlay and land on the result in its project. The query matches one
# item, because results sort by a creation time the fixture cannot hold still.
wait Export posts from the old CMS
press /
wait Search...
frame prompt
type faucet
press enter
wait > ○ Buy the faucet
frame results
press enter
wait > ○ Buy the faucet ≡
frame landed-on-the-item

press q
exits
